WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Import three existing Markdown documents with okn setup.
Then open the knowledge base with okn view.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
Browse connected project notes in the local viewer.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Search for retry behavior to find the delivery decision.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Read the decision and the reason behind it.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
An agent adds a clarification to the shared, unsaved draft.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Review the exact change before saving.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Save the updated note to its Markdown file.

00:30.000 --> 00:33.000
Build it once. Use it in your next task.
Open Knowledge. openknowledge.sh.
